        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "## Review result: incomplete—cost-event evidence unavailable\n\nI identified the relevant work order and September cutoff, but **could not verify whether a cost event was created after Pending Close**. The available records contain work-order and cost-period data, but no cost-event rows; the supporting-record service returned **“supporting records not staged.”** This is not evidence that no late event occurred.\n\n| Required item | Verified result |\n|---|---|\n| Manufacturing order | **MO-25-09-1070** |\n| Work order ID | **WO-2025-09-004** |\n| Operation / product | Modine Racine–Dekoven / Cooler Plate Pack |\n| September cost period | **Sep-25 — PER-COST-2025-09** |\n| Exact Pending Close time | **2025-09-30T18:00:00** |\n| Source transaction | Not verifiable from available evidence |\n| Event amount | Not verifiable |\n| Exact event-created time | Not verifiable |\n| Minutes after Pending Close | Cannot calculate without the event-created time |\n| Recorded accounting status | Not verifiable |\n| Status consistent with Oracle policy? | **Undetermined** |\n\nThe timestamp above is reproduced exactly as recorded; no timezone was supplied.\n\n### Applicable Oracle treatment\n\nOracle Fusion Cloud SCM Cost Management 26B, **“Cost Accounting Period Statuses and Transaction Accounting,” printed page 225 (PDF page 233)**, states that newly created transactions falling in or before a Pending Close period are not staged or processed until the period is closed or reopened. Transactions entered before the cutoff continue processing. **Revenue lines, COGS recognition, and manual cost adjustments are exceptions** that continue processing after Pending Close.\n\nConsequently, a defensible consistency conclusion requires the event’s type, creation time, and recorded accounting status. I have not inferred those missing facts.\n\n**No database records were changed.** The partial audit and provenance were saved to `/cache/work/worker_d33079415b24/audit-report.json`. Report delivery succeeded, but review remains **`needs_evidence`**, not validated.",
